  "summary": "c-ares is an asynchronous resolver library. Versions 1.32.3 through 1.34.5  terminate a query after maximum attempts…",
  "details": "c-ares is an asynchronous resolver library. Versions 1.32.3 through 1.34.5  terminate a query after maximum attempts when using read_answer() and process_answer(), which can cause a Denial of Service. This issue is fixed in version 1.34.6.",
